    "title": "Reflection: An App's Purpose",
    "placeholder": "Enter your reflection here.",
    "long_instructions": "Pick one of the sample apps you explored. Explain the app's purpose, describe one thing you did in the app that showed you its purpose, and name one person who might use it.\r\n\r\n> **Sentence frame (optional):**\r\n>\r\n> The purpose of the _ _ _ app is to _ _ _. I could tell because when I _ _ _, the app _ _ _. A person who might use this app is _ _ _ because _ _ _.",
